      "type": "LinguisticObject",
      "content": "Term developed by Hortense Spillers (1987) to describe the exclusion of enslaved and colonized women from normative gender categories entirely. Distinct from gender nonconformity: ungendering refers to a structural violence rather than a chosen identity position.",
